      "id": "watch_label_1",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 34,
      "text": "every two seconds the window asks, because there is no\nnotifier in the standard library and a stat walk is not a dependency",
      "originalText": "every two seconds the window asks, because there is no\nnotifier in the standard library and a stat walk is not a dependency",
